              "EZR.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of the first month, to go unto Jerusalem: and the hand of our God was upon us, and he delivered us from the hand of the enemy and the lier-in-wait by the way. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
