          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And on the fourth day the silver and the gold and the vessels were weighed in the house of our God into the hand of Meremoth the son of Uriah the priest (and with him was Eleazar the son of Phinehas; and with them was Jozabad the son of Jeshua, and Noadiah the son of Binnui, the Levites)— ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
