          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The children of the captivity, that were come out of exile, offered burnt-offerings unto the God of Israel, twelve bullocks for all Israel, ninety and six rams, seventy and seven lambs, twelve he-goats for a sin-offering: all this was a burnt-offering unto Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
